	(text "A · The antenna path (top layer, 50-ohm coplanar waveguide over the L2 ground)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 16.5 21.5 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "76273760-0884-4135-b693-0e850a2cec03"))
	(text "The nRF9151 has ONE 50-ohm antenna pin. The antenna is the machined aluminium END CAP: a spring finger touches a gold\nland on the cap's feed tab, and the cap + the whole 95 mm body resonate like a small dipole. At 700 MHz (LTE Band 12)\nthe structure is only ~0.22 wavelengths long, so its impedance is far from 50 ohms: the matching network transforms it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19 27 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2c05fd8f-d705-4b90-99b5-3730a1579ac7"))
	(global_label "ANT_RF" (shape passive) (at 27.94 88.9 180) (fields_autoplaced yes)
